            "type": "text",
            "text": "<b id=\"enk2\"><u>এসো নিজে করি ২</u></b><br>\nক) পূর্বে তৈরি করা Teachers টেবিলটিতে নিম্নোক্ত টিচারদের তথ্য রাখ। <br>\n<table border=\"1\", cellpadding=\"10\">\n<thead>\n<tr><th>Id</th><th>Name</th><th>Subject</th><th>Gender</th><th>Salary</th><th>Age</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><th>01</th><th>Sukumar Saha</th><th>ICT</th><th>Male</th><th>36500</th><th>50</th></tr>\n<tr><th>02</th><th>Shakila Nargis</th><th>ICT</th><th>Female</th><th>28000</th><th>35</th></tr>\n<tr><th>03</th><th>Md. Jahangir Alam</th><th>ICT</th><th>Male</th><th>30500</th><th>48</th></tr>\n<tr><th>04</th><th>Naima Akter</th><th>Maths</th><th>Female</th><th>32000</th><th>42</th></tr>\n<tr><th>05</th><th>Kurratun Ayen</th><th>Maths</th><th>Female</th><th>24000</th><th>34</th></tr>\n<tr><th>06</th><th>Monir Ahmed</th><th>Maths</th><th>Male</th><th>28000</th><th>39</th></tr>\n<tr><th>07</th><th>Shahida Akhtar</th><th>English</th><th>Female</th><th>35000</th><th>50</th></tr>\n<tr><th>08</th><th>Shajia Sharmin</th><th>English</th><th>Female</th><th>25000</th><th>30</th></tr>\n<tr><th>09</th><th>Mohammad Ali Bhuiyan</th><th>English</th><th>Male</th><th>26000</th><th>36</th></tr>\n<tr><th>10</th><th>Shaila Nasreen</th><th>Physics</th><th>Female</th><th>40000</th><th>44</th></tr>\n<tr><th>11</th><th>Selina Sultana</th><th>Physics</th><th>Female</th><th>42000</th><th>48</th></tr>\n<tr><th>12</th><th>Dipali Rani Shaha</th><th>Biology</th><th>Female</th><th>22000</th><th>32</th></tr>\n<tr><th>13</th><th>Muhammad Humayun Kabir</th><th>Biology</th><th>Male</th><th>34000</th><th>52</th></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\nখ) এবার Select কুয়েরি ব্যবহার করে দেখ সব ঠিক আছে কি না।"
